Description:It is the opponent's turn (main phase 2). The opponent controls Lavinia, Azorius Renegade and Tithe Taker. You control five lands (two Mountains, two Forests, a Plains) and have Violent Outburst in hand. The top card of your library is Grizzly Bears. End the turn with Grizzly Bears on the battlefield.
Rule:ask-a-magic-judge-3a7e97f8eef8eae0 | Tithe Taker's tax is an additional cost (CR 601.2f), so a cascaded spell cast without paying its mana cost still has mana spent and Lavinia does not counter it
